@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminToken = replace-after-admin-login
@clientToken = replace-after-client-login
@categoryId = replace-with-response-id
@imageId = replace-with-response-id
@productId = replace-with-response-id
@skuId = replace-with-response-id
@addressId = replace-with-response-id
@quoteId = replace-with-response-quoteId
@orderId = replace-with-response-id
@orderItemId = replace-with-response-items-id
@afterSaleId = replace-with-response-id
@refundId = replace-with-response-refundId
@shipmentId = replace-with-response-id

# 先执行数据库迁移、CLI 创建管理员。测试付款需 COMMERCE_TEST_PAYMENTS=true。
# 用户注册登录参见 auth.http；普通用户和管理员令牌不能混用。
# 以下 version 为结构示例，每次操作必须读取资源最新 version。
# 每个业务请求使用独立幂等键；仅重试原请求时复用同键。

### 管理员登录
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"commerce_admin","password":"replace-with-your-password"}

### 分类
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"护理用品","scope":"PRODUCT"}

### 登记已经托管的公开 HTTPS 商品图片（示例 URL 需替换）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/product-images
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"publicUrl":"https://example.com/product.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","sizeBytes":1024}

### 商品草稿
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"测试商品","summary":"商品说明","coverMediaId":"{{imageId}}","categoryId":"{{categoryId}}","detailHtml":"<p>产品介绍</p>","afterSalePolicy":"确认收货后七天内可申请售后"}

### SKU
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/{{productId}}/skus
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"skuCode":"DEMO-001","attributes":[{"name":"规格","value":"标准装"}],"priceCents":4900}

### 入库
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/skus/{{skuId}}/stock-adjustments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-stock-adjustment-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"delta":100,"reason":"测试入库"}

### 获取商品最新 version 后发布
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 发布，创建 SKU 已使产品版本增加
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/products/{{productId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2}

### 普通用户添加地址
POST {{baseUrl}}/me/addresses
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"recipient":"测试用户","phone":"+8613800000000","provinceCode":"310000","province":"上海市","cityCode":"310100","city":"上海市","districtCode":"310101","district":"黄浦区","detail":"测试路100号","isDefault":true}

### 试算
POST {{baseUrl}}/order-quotes
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type":"PRODUCT","addressId":"{{addressId}}","items":[{"skuId":"{{skuId}}","quantity":2}]}

### 下单
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-order-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"quoteId":"{{quoteId}}"}

### 管理员确认测试付款，没有真实扣款
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/test-payment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-test-payment-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"transactionNo":"demo-payment-001"}

### 本人订单详情
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 路径 A：发货（与下面未发货仅退款示例是不同分支）
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders/{{orderId}}/shipment
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-order-shipment-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"carrierCode":"SF","trackingNo":"SF1234567890","orderVersion":2}

### 查询本人物流
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/logistics
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}

### 路径 B：未发货时申请部分退款；已发货应改为 RETURN_REFUND
POST {{baseUrl}}/aftersales
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-create-aftersale-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"orderId":"{{orderId}}","type":"REFUND_ONLY","items":[{"orderItemId":"{{orderItemId}}","quantity":1}],"reasonCode":"NOT_NEEDED","description":"测试退款","evidenceMediaIds":[]}

### 审核仅退款，返回 refundId；退货退款审核还需 returnAddress
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/aftersales/{{afterSaleId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-review-aftersale-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":1,"decision":"APPROVE","note":"同意退款"}

### 测试退款完成：version 是售后单版本
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/refunds/{{refundId}}/test-result
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-test-refund-001
Content-Type: application/json

{"version":2,"result":"SUCCEEDED"}

### 本人退款记录
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}/refunds
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
